    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of the LakJanasetha Foundation (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members of theCorporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate, withperpetual succession, under the name and style of the \u201cLakJanasetha Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued with fullpower and authority to have and use a common seal and to alterthe same at its pleasure.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be \u2014\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof the LakJanasethaFoundation.\n\nThe generalobjects of theCorporation.\n\n25\n\n2Lak Janasetha Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b) to formulate systematic and effective programmes foreradicating proverty;\n\n(c) to promote mutual understanding and co-operationat social and national level in the human society;\n\n(d) to plan and implement community welfare,educational and social development projects in SriLanka;\n\n(e) to promote education, health, recreation,culture andagriculture, to provide grants, scholarships, gifts,donations and financial assistance for theimprovement, extension and publicize knowledgeand to establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(f) to assist for the uplift of the visually-impaired, sound-impaired disabled, destitute, those suffering fromincurable diseases and mentally-retarded, to establishand maintain centres for this purpose;\n\n(g) to establish and maintain affiliated institutions forthe attainment of the objectives of the corporationand do other things required for the purpose;\n\n(h) to assist in scholarship, cash or kind for the voluntaryemployees and other employees who are engaged inthe attainment of the objectives of the Corporation;"
