    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Lasallian CommunityEducation Services (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be \u2014\n\n(a) providing the vocational training with collaborationof the National Apprentice and Industrial Training\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof theLasallianCommunityEducationServices.\n\nThe generalobjects of theCorporation.\n\n25\n\n2Lasallian Community Education Services(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAuthoritly (NAITA) and Tertiary and VocationalEducation Commission (TVEC) and VocationalTraining Authority (VTA) for youths between the ageof 16 - 25 years who have left the school education;\n\n(b) providing the kindergarten school service for thechildren of the poor parents;\n\n(c) implementing rehabilitation programs for the fresherswho are addicted to drugs;\n\n(d) educating the children of the underdeveloped societyliving in slums who are not schooling;\n\n(e) giving meals to non-schooling children who aresuffering from hunger due to poverty and nourishthem and direct them to obtain education;\n\n(f) implementing the group programs engaging thechildren through child focused communitydevelopment (CFCD) and promoting them for betteradulthood;\n\n(g) providing nutritious program for infants, pregnantand feeding mothers;\n\n(h) implementing suitable group programs for thechildren who are mentally retarded;\n\n(i) implementing volunteer employment program to theneedy mothers by giving them loans, aid and providigthem with necessary counseling (SHG-Self HelpGroup);\n\n(j) awareness program to the children through suchactivities as religious, cultural and sports.\n\nLasallian Community Education Services(Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to \u2014"
