    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by the Hon. Mohan Priyadarshana De Silva, M.P. forGalle District on 23rd June, 2016\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 118]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on January 18, 2016)\n\nGANEGAMA SRI INDASARA DHARMAYATHANASANRAKSHANA SABHAWA (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Ganegama Sri Indasara DharmayathanaSanrakshana Sabhawa\n\nGanegama Sri Indasara DharmayathanaSanrakshana Sabhawa (Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE GANEGAMA SRI INDASARADHARMAYATHANA SANRAKSHANA SABHAWA\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cGanegama Sri Indasara Dharmayathana SanrakshanaSabhawa\u201d has heretofore been established at Ganegama,Baddegama in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carryingout and transacting all objects and matters connected to byits members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and fulfilled the several objects andmatters for which it was established, and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Ganegama Sri IndasaraDharmayathana Sanrakshana Sabhawa (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2016."
  },
