    "chunk_text": "(2) The office of the Director which will fall vacant afterthe present Director shall be filled by electing a Bhikku wellversed in and devoted to the observance of Buddhist doctrineand who belongs to this monastic sector.\n\n(4) All matters connected with the admission of pupils,their expulsion, appointment of Parivenadhipathi and teachersand their dismissal, disciplinary control, furnishing facilitiesto the pupil bhikkus and making arrangements for the trainingand education etc. shall be the powers and responsibilities ofthe Director.\n\n14.(1) If there is a balance money belonging to theCorporation after incurring expenditure, it shall be creditedto the Current Account No. 1534 named \u201cIndasaraDharmayathana Sanrakshana Fund\u201d at People\u2019s Bank,Baddegama Branch.\n\n(2) The Director and one out of the Treasurer and theSecretary shall sign the cheques and the necessary documentsin respect of bank transactions.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nFunds of theCorporation.\n\nDirectorshipand itspowers.\n\n6Ganegama Sri Indasara DharmayathanaSanrakshana Sabhawa (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nSaving of theRights of theRepublic andothers.\n\n15.Nothing in this Act contained shall prejudice oraffect the rights of the Republic or of any body politic orcorporate or of any other person, except such as arementioned in this Act, and those claiming by, from or underthem.\n\n16.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala text and Tamil text of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.\n\nGanegama Sri Indasara DharmayathanaSanrakshana Sabhawa (Incorporation)7\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
