    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nCODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by the Minister of Justice on 21st June, 2016\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 3.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 116]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 08, 2016)\n\nto amend the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15 of 1979\n\n2\u2014PL 010026\u2014475 (06/2016)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 431 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to\u2014\n\n(a)make provision to reduce the period granted for a person to establish his claim forseized property taken under section 29 or stolen; and\n\n(b)increase the value of the property for which notification is required under thatsection.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 432 of the principal enactment and provides for aconsequential amendment to the marginal note of that section.\n\n1Code of Criminal Procedure(Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 009775\u2014425 (02/2016)\n\nShort title.\n\nL. D.\u2014O. 44/2015.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2016.\n\n2.Section 431 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:\u2014\n\n(a)in subsection (2) of that section, by the substitutionfor the words \u201cwithin six months\u201d of the words\u201cwithin two months\u201d; and\n\n(b)in subsection (3) of that section, by the substitutionfor the words \u201ctwo thousand five hundred rupees ormore.\u201d of the words \u201ctwenty five thousand rupeesor more.\u201d."
