    "chunk_text": "(h)to do all such other things as may be necessary for,or incidental or conducive to the attainment of theobjects of the Corporation, and generally for thebenefit, advancement and welfare of its members.\n\nGeneralpowers of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n3Sri Lanka Women\u2019s Conference (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nCorporation and to engage, employ and dismiss, officersand servants required for the carrying out of the objects ofthe Corporation.\n\n5.The Board of Management of the Corporation shallcause to be maintained a register in which every person whoon the date of commencement of this Act, is a member of theCorporation and every person thereafter duly admitted amember of the Corporation shall have inscribed in suchregister his name, address and such other particulars as maybe prescribed under the rules in force for the time being ofthe Corporation.\n\n6.(1) The management, control and administration ofthe Corporation shall subject to the provisions of this Actand rules in force for the time being of the Corporation, vestin a Governing Council (hereinafter referred to as \u201ctheCouncil\u201d) consisting of such number of governors electedfrom among the members in accordance with the rules inforce for the time being of the Corporation.\n\n(2) The members of the Governing Council of theConference whose names are set out in the Schedule to thisAct, and holding office on the day preceding the date ofcommencement of this, shall be the members of the firstCouncil of the Corporation.\n\n(3) The Council shall have the power to appoint newmembers."
