    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of the SisiraJayakody Siyapatha Foundation (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members of theCorporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate, withperpetual succession, under the name and style of the \u201cSisiraJayakody Siyapatha Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued withfull power and authority to have and use a common seal and toalter the same at its pleasure.\n\n(a) to grant scholarships and other assistance to the needychildren to continue their education from the pre-school stage to university;\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof the SisiraJayakodySiyapathaFoundation.\n\nThe generalobjects of theCorporation.\n\n25\n\n2Sisira Jayakody Siyapatha Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b) to conduct various studies, lectures and seminars inorder to encourage the self employments;\n\n(c) to provide facilities to the helpless persons who wishto pilgrimage the various places of worship;\n\n(d) to support the children of war heroes and disabledwarriors in their educational needs and to providehousing facilities for those families;\n\n(e) to provide material support to the undeveloped ruralschools;\n\n(f) to rehabilitate the religious places which have beennot paid attention so far;\n\n(g) to implement a mobile service programme called\u201cJana Sahana\u201d with the aim of looking into the mattersand solving the various problems faced by people;\n\n(h) to help those children who need special care providingthem necessary educational, vocational and healthaid to fulfill their needs;\n\n(i) to provide help in order to meet the housing needs ofthe destitute who suffer without shelters;\n\n(j) to provide humanitarian support to those who facednatural disasters or any other disasters;"
