    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so may persons as now are members of the\u201cDr. Saman Weerasinghe Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted asmembers shall be a body corporate (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession under the nameand style of \u201cDr. Saman Weerasinghe Foundation\u201d and bythat name may sue and be sued in all Courts, with full powerand authority to have and use a common seal and to alter thesame at its pleasure.\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theDr. SamanWeerasingheFoundation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) to provide advice and support for all communitiesin Sri Lanka to live in peace and harmony;\n\n(b) to provide facilities to pre-school children and grantscholarship to them;\n\n(c) to provide facilities to safeguard and maintain ethicsand culture;\n\n(d) to supply the necessary equipments and facilities ofthe poor school children to develop their studies;\n\n(e) to provide medical and food to the poor, the destituteand the sick;\n\n(f) to establish libraries to promote education andresearch;\n\n(g) to work towards to protect and develop all rights ofwomen and children;\n\n(h) to protect and make known human rights, humanitiesand fundamental rights;\n\n(i) to organize leadership programmes;\n\n(j) to liaise and co-ordinate with other local and foreigninstructions or foundations which have similarobjects.\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to theother provisions of this Act and the rules in force for the timebeing of the Corporation be administered by a Board ofDirectors consisting of Chairman and Secretary, Treasurerand another eleven members elected in accordance withsuch rules.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Dr. Saman Weerasinghe Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
