    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Associationfor Child Development (SLACD) (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2016.\n\n2\u2014PL 009829\u2014300 (03/2016)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theSri LankaAssociationfor ChildDevelopment(SLACD).\n\nSri Lanka Association for Child Development(SLACD) (Incorporation)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to promote, facilitate and support the advancementof professional knowledge and skills in childdevelopment;\n\n(b)to carry out, promote, facilitate and support researchand interest in child development and developmentdisorders in children;\n\n(c)to strive for the development of children and welfareof children with development disorders;\n\n(d)to advocate to improve the quality of life of childrenwith development disorders and children in generaland their families;\n\n(e)the purpose of the SLACD shall be to promote,facilitate and support advancement of knowledgeand skills;\n\n(f)research and interest in child development anddevelopmental disorders in children; and\n\n(g)the SLACD will strive to apply these purposes forthe welfare of children concerned, their familiesand the community through activities determinedby the Council of the SLACD.\n\nSLACD may receive, use and hold donations and gifts,financial and in other kind, in order to carry forward theabove mentioned purposes.\n\nSLACD shall always be operated solely for the aforesaidpurposes, without discrimination, provided that no part ofits resources are used for the benefit of or be distributable toany member, or office bearer of the SLACD or any private\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Sri Lanka Association for Child Development(SLACD) (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
