    "chunk_text": "SLACD shall always be operated solely for the aforesaidpurposes, without discrimination, provided that no part ofits resources are used for the benefit of or be distributable toany member, or office bearer of the SLACD or any private\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Sri Lanka Association for Child Development(SLACD) (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAdvocacy to improve the quality of life for those individualsand families served by SLACD and its members is inaccordance with the purposes of SLACD. The SLACD shallnot participate in, or intervene in (including the publishingand distribution of statements) any political campaign onbehalf of any candidate for public office. All such activitiesmust not exceed limitations as described in Article 2,Section 2.\n\n4.(1) There shall be 5 classes of members namely, LifeMembers, Ordinary Members, Overseas Members, HonoraryMembers and Associate Members. All members shall havethe right to attend meetings.\n\nAll members will have the right to vote except AssociateMembers. The right to hold office shall be confined to LifeMembers and Ordinary Members of SLACD.\n\nAnnual membership fees for Ordinary Members, AssociateMembers and Foreign Members shall be amounts determinedby the Council. One-time fee for Life Membership shall alsobe determined by the Council.\n\n(2) The qualifications for Ordinary Members and LifeMembers are as follows:\u2014\n\n(a)should be a citizen of Sri Lanka;\n\n30\n\nMembership.\n\nSri Lanka Association for Child Development(SLACD) (Incorporation)4\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n(b)doctors with postgraduate qualifications whomanifest by their work a significant interest andcompetence in child development anddevelopmental disorders and whose professionalactivity is inconsistent with the purposes of theSLACD;\n\n(c) other individuals with appropriate postgraduatequalifications who manifest by their work asignificant interest and competence in childdevelopment and developmental disorders andwhose professional activity is consistent with thepurposes of the SLACD;"
