    "chunk_text": "(j)to conduct and promote the studies on the basicprinciples of Ahulus Sunnath Waljama\u2019ath throughthe above library and Madrasa ;\n\n(k)to equip the library with books to conductresearches to promote the Islam Religion and theThareeqas and Madrasa; and\n\n3Al-Jamiathul Ghawsiyyah (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute, all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever, as are necessary and desirable for the promotionor furtherance of the objects of the Corporation includingthe power to open, operate and close bank accounts, toborrow or raise money with or without security,to receive orto collect grants and donations from the Mureedeens,Muhibbeens, followers and well-wishers and to invest itsfunds to construct any buildings on any land vested in, oracquired or held by the Corporation, and to engage, employand dismiss personnel for the purpose of carrying out of theobjects of the Corporation.\n\n5.(1) The Spiritual Heads of the Corporation shall bethe Life Patrons of the Corporation as long as they continueto be such Spiritual Heads His Holiness Assaiyyidh AsshheikhKoya Thangal Al-Qadhiriyyah War-Rifa\u2019iyyah(Qaddasallahu Sirrahul Azeez).\n\n(2) The Spiritual Heads of the association on the date ofcommencement of this Act and thereafter, are namely\u2014\n\n(a)His Holiness Assaiyyidh Hassan Koya Thangal ;\n\n(b)His Holiness Assaiyyidh Hussain Koya Thangal ;\n\n(c)and their rightful descendants and successors asnominated by them.\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\nGeneralpowers of theCorporation.\n\n4Al-Jamiathul Ghawsiyyah (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n6.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to therules in force for the time being fo the Corporation, beadministered by a Board of Administration consisting ofsuch number of persons as may be provided for in such rulesand appointed periodically by the Life Patrons at their solediscretion."
