    "md5": "539b999566317e22420b1b56084bc49f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1709,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Poddala-MeepawalaSri Sudarshanarama Viharaya Educational Relief Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2013\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof thePoddala -MeepawalaSriSudarshanaramaViharayaEducationalReliefFoundation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.30\n\n2 Poddala-Meepawala Sri Sudarshanarama ViharayaEducational Relief Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(a)to grant scholarships annually by to those childrenselected from the poor income families livingpermanently at the Gramaseva Niladhari Divisionsin the vicinity of Poddala-Meepawala Viharaya ;and who has the knowledge and are active and able;\n\n(b)to consider it as a basic qualification, that everyscholarship recipients must attend a Damma schoolin order to foster the Buddhist Education andBuddhist Culture;\n\n(c)to grant scholarship annually to those students whoare differently able or lost parents; and\n\n(d)to protect the good manners of respecting theclergymen and teachers; and caring the parents andelders which are evading from the society, througheducating the students such good manners.\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject tothe rule in force for the time being of the Corporation, beadministered by a Board of Trustees elected in accordancewith the rules of the Corporation.\n\n(2) The first Board of Trustees of the Corporation shallconsist of the members of the Board of Management of theFoundation holding office on the day preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act."
