    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 83]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Namal Rajapaksa, M.P. for Hambantota Districton 24th February, 2016\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 30, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10. 00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nKAHAWILGODA JATHIKA URUMA UYANACONCEPT MUSEUM DEVELOPMENT FUND(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Kahawilgoda Jathika Uruma Uyana Concept MuseumDevelopment Fund\n\n1Kahawilgoda Jathika Uruma Uyana ConceptMuseum Development Fund (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE KAHAWILGODA JATHIKA URUMA UYANACONCEPT MUSEUM DEVELOPMENT FUND (INCORPORATION)\n\nWHEREAS a Fund called and known as the \u201cKahawilgodaJathika Uruma Uyana Concept Museum Development Fund\u201dhas heretofore been established for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said Fund, in accordance with the rules agreed to byits members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Fund has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was established and has applied to be incorporatedand it will be for the public advantage to grant theapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kahawilgoda JathikaUruma Uyana Concept Museum Development Fund(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016."
  },
