    "chunk_text": "3Kahawilgoda Jathika Uruma Uyana ConceptMuseum Development Fund (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(ii)the Director-General of Central Cultural Fund;\n\n(iii)the Chief Secretary of Southern Provincial Council;\n\n(v)the Director-General of the National PhysicalPlanning Department.\n\n(3) Every member of the Corporation unless he vacatesoffice earlier by death, resignation, removal or becomes aMember of Parliament/Provincial Council/LocalGovernment will hold office for a period of five years fromthe date of his appointment.\n\n(4) Every member of the Corporation may resign his officeby a letter addressed in that behalf to the His Excellency thePresident of Sri Lanka and such resignaion shall take effectupon it being accepted by the His Excellency the Presidentof Sri Lanka.\n\n(5) Any member except ex-officio member of theCorporation may be removed from membership afterconsulting Nayaka Thero of the Kahawilgoda PuranaViharaya.\n\n(6) Where any member of the Corporation dies, resings oris removed from office, the His Excellency the President ofSri Lanka shall appoint another person on therecommendation of the Nayaka Thero of the KahavilgodaPurana Viharaya, and the person so appointed shall holdoffice for the unexpired period of the term of office of themember whom he succeeds.\n\n(7) Any member of the Corporation who vacates office,by affiliation of time shall be eligible for reappointment.\n\n5.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from timeto time, at any General Meeting of the members and by the\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\nKahawilgoda Jathika Uruma Uyana ConceptMuseum Development Fund (Incorporation)4\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nvotes of not less than two thirds of the members present andvoting at such meeting to make rules, not inconsistent withthe management of the affairs of the Corporation and theaccomplishment of its objects. Such rules when made may,at a like meeting and in like manner, be altered, added to,amended or rescinded."
