    "chunk_size_bytes": 1550,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of February 19, 2016\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 23. 02. 2016)\n\nNADUATHUL ULAMA ARABIC COLLEGE, MUTUR(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Naduathul Ulama Arabic College, Mutur\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. M. S. Thowfeek, M.P.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Naduathul Ulama Arabic College, Mutur(Incorporation)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theNaduathulUlama ArabicCollege,Mutur.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE NADUATHUL ULAMA ARABICCOLLEGE, MUTUR\n\nWHEREAS an College called and known as the\u201cNaduathul Ulama Arabic College\u201d has been formed atMutur, Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually fulfillingand carrying out all the objects and matters connected withthe said \u201cNaduathul Ulama Arabic College\u201d according tothe rules agreed to by its members and whereas the saidinstitution has heretofore successfully carried out andtransacted the several objects and matters for which it wasestablished:\n\nAND the Board of Management of the said \u201cMutur NaduathulUlama Arabic College\u201d has applied to incorporate the collegeand it will be for the public advantage to grant suchapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Naduathul Ulama ArabicCollege, Mutur (Incorporation) Act, No. 2016."
