    "chunk_size_bytes": 1757,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Naduathul Ulama ArabicCollege, Mutur (Incorporation) Act, No. 2016.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2Naduathul Ulama Arabic College, Mutur(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to improve the religious, educational, social,economical and cultural development of Muslimsin Sri Lanka;\n\n(b)to encourge the teaching of Arabic Language, itsgrammar, literature, verse and prose and poems, andother similar subects to enable the students to gainthe complete knowledge, skills and abilities inArabic Language;\n\n(c)to improve the teaching of \u2018Sharia\u2019 or Islamic Lawin accordance with \u2018Fiqh\u2019 \u2018Tafseer\u2019 and \u2018Hadeeths\u2019and other similar subjects which are available inArabic language;\n\n(d)to encourage the teaching of recital of \u2018Al Quran\u2019according to \u2018Thajweed\u2019 and \u2018Hifdhul Quran\u2019, therecital from memory of the \u2018Holy Quran\u2019;\n\n(e)to encourage the teaching of other subjects similarto these, which are available in Arabic Languageand are helpful to the students to gain an intenseknowledge in matters mentioned in paragraph (a),(b), (c) and (d); and\n\n(f)to do all the acts and things which are necessary orconducive to the attainment of the above mentionedobjects or any one of them since they are notinconsistent with the provisions of this Act or anyother written law :\n\nProvided always that the subjects referred to in this sectionshall be exclusively in accordance with the \u201cSunnathWaljamaath\u201d.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n3Naduathul Ulama Arabic College, Mutur(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
  },
