    "md5": "ded936e33485e8ebe559b8b19b0dca41",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2025,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri GunarathanaInternational Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2016.\n\nIncorporationof the SriGunarathanaInternationalFoundation.\n\n2Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to take necessary action for the extension andprotection of Buddhism;\n\n(b)to assist in the establishment of Dhamma schools,to establish and conduct of centres for this purpose;\n\n(c)to take action for the conservation and theprotection of social values;\n\n(d)to establish institutions which are actively involvedin eradication social unrest;\n\n(e)to formulate systematic and effective programmesfor eradicating poverty;\n\n(f)to organize activites for the social welfare anddevelopment, using physical resources andknowledge which are inherent to Sri Lanka;\n\n(g)to promote mutual understanding and co-operationas social and national level in the human society;\n\n(h)to plan and implement community welfare,educational and social development projects inSri Lanka;\n\n(i)to promote education, health, recreation, cultureand agriculture, to provide grants, scholarships,gifts, donations and financial assistance for theimprovement, extension and publicize knowledgeand to establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(j)to promote areas relating to traditional knowledgeand establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(k)to commence and maintain projects for theprotection and conservation of the environment;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(l)to grow and maintain herbal plants and other plantsrequired to produce indigenous medicine;\n\n(m)to commence herbal parks and gardens and toprovide assistance for this purpose;\n\n(n)to open and maintain sales outlets to purchase,distribute and sell ayurvedic medicines;"
  },
