    "chunk_size_bytes": 2010,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kotasara PiyangalaRajamaha Viharastha Development Society (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2015.\n\nIncorporationof theKotasaraPiyangalaRajamahaViharasthaDevelopmentSociety.\n\n2Kotasara Piyangala Rajamaha ViharasthaDevelopment Society (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n3.The general objects for which Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)provision of necessities, maintenance and carryingout Wegama Sri Saddarmalankara Vidyayatanaya,Wegama Sri Sobhita Dharmayatanaya, MapakadaSri Swarnajothi Dhamma School, Kotasara PeraheraOrganization and Kotasara Sathara PeruwaAvamangalyadara Samithi affiliated to the KotasaraPiyangala Raja Maha Viharastha SanwardenaSabhawa, to organize activities to bring aboutreligious fervour among Buddhists and to promotesocial and economic activities of the people in thearea ;\n\n(b)to preserve and develop as a place of religious andcultural importance by the erection of a parapetwall and Wahalkada in the above mentionedWiharastha New Dhamma Hall, creation of anorchard in the premises of this Institute ;\n\n(c)to provide housing and health facilities and waterto poor and destitute in the area ;\n\n(d)to provide facilities to poor children in the relevantdistrict to improve their education ;\n\n(e)to promote, encourage and assist in, activities forthe spiritual, cultural, social and physical welfare ofits members ;\n\n(f)to safeguard and propagate Buddhism ;\n\n(g)to communicate the message contained in theteachings of the Buddha and to propogate Buddhistculture with a view to promoting world peace ;\n\n(h)to present the Buddhist point of view on any matter,on behalf of the Buddist community at conferencesand seminars on global problems relating toeducation culture, communications survival,development and peace, convened by anyinternational, governmental or non-governmentalorganizations, whether religious or secular ;"
  },
