    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 47]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Ali Zahir Moulana Seyed, M. P. for Batticaloa Districton 11th December, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 23, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nCASIMI FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nto incorporate the Casimi Foundation\n\n2\u2014PL 009565\u2014 225 (12/2015)\n\n1Casimi Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 009381\u2014300 (11/2015)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE CASIMI FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cCasimiFoundation\u201d has heretofore been established for the purposeof effectually carrying out and transacting all objects andmatters connected with the said Foundation according tothe rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated, and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cCasimi Foundation\u201d(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n2.From and after the commencement of this Act, suchand so many persons as presently are members of the CasimiFoundation (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) orshall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporationhereby constituted, shall be a body corporate (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual successionunder the name and style of the \u201cCasimi Foundation\u201d andby that name may sue and be sued in all courts with fullpower and authority to have and use a common seal and toalter the same at its pleasure."
