    "chunk_size_bytes": 1561,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 48]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Ali Zahir Moulana, M. P. for Batticaloa Districton 11th December, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 23, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nSEYYED SHEIKH KOYA THANGAL MOWLANAFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nto incorporate the Seyyed Sheikh Koya Thangal Mowlana Foundation\n\n1Seyyed Sheikh Koya Thangal Mowlana Foundation(Incorporation)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SEYYED SHEIKH KOYA THANGALMOWLANA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Foundation called and known as the \"SeyyedSheikh Koya Thangal Mowlana Foundation\" has heretoforebeen formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said Foundation according to the rules agreed to byits members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Seyyed Sheikh KoyaThangal Mowlana Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2015."
  },
