    "chunk_text": "(j)to promote areas relating to traditional knowledgeand establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(k)to commence and maintain projects for theprotection and conservation of the environment;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(l)to grow and maintain herbal plants and other plantsrequired to produce indigenous medicine;\n\n(m)to commence herbal parks and gardens and toprovide assistance for this purpose;\n\n(n)to open and maintain sales outlets to purchase,distribute and sell ayurvedic medicines;\n\n(o)to import and export ayurvedic medicines;\n\n(p)to award scholarships to local and foreign students,to send students for foreign scholarships andmatteres connected thereto;\n\n(q)to provide education of university level on variouslanguages and various subjects and to awardcertificates and to establish institutions for thispurpose;\n\n(r)to assist for the uplift of the visually-impaired,sound-impaired, disabled, destitute, those sufferingfrom incurable diseases and mentally-retarded, toestablish and maintain centres for this purpose;\n\n(s)to establish and maintain affiliated institutions forthe attainment of the objectives of the corporationand do other things required for the purpose;\n\n(t)to engage in an industry, trade or export or importenterprise and to assist persons to conductagricultural, industrial and commercial enterprisesand industries, to extend training programmes forproviding technology and techniques and toorganize propaganda;\n\n(u)to assist in scholarship, cash or kind for thevoluntary employees and other employees who areengaged in the attainment of the objectives of theCorporation;\n\n4Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(v)to establish and conduct libraries, to assist inprinting and publishing of books, magazines,souvenirs, journals, cassettes, compact disks andsoftware and to provide other services necessaryto the attainment of the objectives of theCorporation ;"
