    "chunk_text": "Insertion ofnew section28A to theprincipalenactment.\n\n\u201cProhibitionof TrawlingOperations.\n\nFisheries and Aquatic Resources (Amendment)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\napplications for the renewal of such a licenseshall not be entertained:\n\n3.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 49(6) of the principal enactmentand shall have effect as section 49(7) of that enactment.\n\n49 (7). Any person who contravenes or failsto comply with the provisions of section 28Aof this Act shall commit an offence and shallon conviction after summary trial before aMagistrate be liable to an imprisonment for aterm not exceeding two years or to a fine notless than fifty thousand rupees.\u201d.\n\n4.Section 66 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the insertion, immediately after the definitionof the expression \u201cSri Lanka Waters\u201d, of the following newdefinitions:\u2014\n\n\u201cTrawl Net\u201d means towing nets having a coneshaped body and a bag or cod end (madiya)connected to the apex with or without twowings connected to the other end.\n\n\u201cTrawling\u201d means any fishing operation carried outby dragging a Trawl Net mechanically alongthe bed or in mid water.\n\n5.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n\u201cOffences.\n\nAmendmentof section 66of theprincipalenactment.\n\nInsertion ofnew section49(7) to theprincipalenactment.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase of anyinconsistency.\n\n3Fisheries and Aquatic Resources (Amendment)\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
